WEBVTT

STYLE

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.500
Put your hand on your chest

00:00:01.724 --> 00:00:02.824
Can you feel it?

00:00:02.848 --> 00:00:04.548
Thump, Thump, Thump

00:00:04.572 --> 00:00:08.072
That's the sound of me working hard. Pumping blood all around your body

00:00:08.696 --> 00:00:12.096
Oh my Goodness! What? Who are you?

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.220
Hi! I'm ECG

00:00:14.244 --> 00:00:17.244
My job is to help doctors make sure you stay healthy

00:00:17.568 --> 00:00:19.168
Really? How?

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:21.392
By placing these little cameras on your body

00:00:21.916 --> 00:00:22.916
Don't worry

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.140
They don't hurt at all

00:00:24.864 --> 00:00:26.164
What do these cameras do?

00:00:26.288 --> 00:00:28.188
When you're pumping blood and moving around

00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:29.412
They help me see your movements

00:00:29.536 --> 00:00:31.036
And draw pictures of them

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.060
Just Remember

00:00:32.184 --> 00:00:34.784
Before the test, your skin should be clean

00:00:34.808 --> 00:00:37.308
And you shouldn't put any lotion or oil on it

00:00:37.632 --> 00:00:38.932
Alright, ECG

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.256
Great! Now, While I attach the cameras

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.480
Try not to talk

00:00:42.504 --> 00:00:44.404
And stay as still as you can

00:00:46.628 --> 00:00:48.328
That's so cool!

00:00:48.352 --> 00:00:50.152
I can see my own heartbeat right here

00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:51.876
See these lines?

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.900
They show what a healthy heart looks like

00:00:54.124 --> 00:00:59.224
Wow! I'm gonna play, exercise and eat lots of healthy foods to stay strong

00:00:59.348 --> 00:01:00.448
Thanks, ECG

00:01:01.072 --> 00:01:03.772
Now I know so much more about myself

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:06.096
From now on, I'll take even better care